    "updated_at": "2016-05-04T16:59:19Z",
    "body": "While working on this I noticed we have a lot of \"`document`\", \"`<code>Document</code>`\", and \"`<code>Document</code> object`\". We should probably pick one and stick with it. I vote for `<span>document</span>` linking to https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document as that reads the easiest and is easiest to remember.\n",
